        F2   G2-        GB`cB | c8                  |
        F2   G2         B2 B2 | BB```cB        c3  B|[M:2/4] c4  |
[M:4/4] B2   BB         cB c2 | Bc```dc       _BA`BA|[M:2/4](AG3)|
[M:4/4] DD   FF        (E C3) | DD```A_B       AG2 A|[M:2/4] G4  |
[M:4/4] FG   B2         BB B2-| BB```cB        c4   |\
